              "\t\t\t\tAND m.AM_DT_RecipientMessageType = '16C507EE-68BE-4D1F-9888-BE865204A388' -- rt.DT_Code = 'http://www.cargowise.com/ehub/clients/edi/2010/06#FWB'",
