              "\t\t\t\tAND m.AM_ReceivedFromSenderUTC < @dt0",
              "\t\t\t) MyTable1",
              "\t\t) MyTable2</RSQueryCommandText><RSQueryCommandType>Text</RSQueryCommandType><RSQueryDesignState></RSQueryDesignState>]]></AnnotationContent></Gemini>"
